  <goal>
    A new `src/solutions/sprk_communicationspage/` Code Page exists — a ~50-line shell copying `sprk_invoicespage/src/main.tsx` (mounting `<DataGridPageShell configId="e1826c4c-9575-f111-ab0e-7ced8ddc4a05">` with no `parentContext`, global scope) — registered in `scripts/Deploy-AllDataGridConsumers.ps1`. It renders the DataGrid with auto-derived channel/person/date/regarding chips off the reused config (no second default). NO permanent sitemap entry (Q-B). Builds + deploys via the DataGrid consumers script.
