  <context>
    <background>
      Surface 2 of R2 is the standalone All-Communications view. The DataGrid framework + the "Active Communications" grid config are ALREADY BUILT (from `ai-spaarke-ai-workspace-UI-r2`): config record `sprk_gridconfiguration` GUID `e1826c4c-9575-f111-ab0e-7ced8ddc4a05`, entity `sprk_communication`; framework at `src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/DataGrid/` (+ `DataGridPageShell.tsx`); views + filter chips auto-derived (`filterChips/chipDiscovery.ts`) — channel/person/date/regarding appear OOB when the column is in the view's layoutXml (investigation §3). So the standalone page is a ~50-line shell: copy `src/solutions/sprk_invoicespage/src/main.tsx`, swap the configId + title, and register in the deploy script.

      §11 Component Justification: no communications standalone page exists today (investigation §3). Existing overlap (grep): none — `sprk_invoicespage` is matter-scoped invoices, not communications. Extension test: the shell IS the copy-the-pattern approach; there is no page to extend. Cost-of-doing-nothing: there is no standalone All-Communications entry point (spec req 4, grid half). The shell is a thin copy, not a new load-bearing component.

      Owner Q-B (LOCKED 2026-07-18): the page is **widget/launcher only for R2 — no permanent sitemap entry**. Ship the shell + the `Deploy-AllDataGridConsumers.ps1` registration; defer permanent sitemap/app placement to a later config pass. Reach the page via the widget/launcher/deep link.

      The invoices page mounts the shell with a matter-scoped `parentContext` (drill-through). The All-Communications page is GLOBAL — omit the matter-id parsing and pass no `parentContext` (or `undefined`). No BFF changes — the grid reads via `Xrm.WebApi` through `XrmDataverseClient` (`docs/standards/DATA-ACCESS-DECISION-CRITERIA.md`); root §10 (BFF hygiene, publish-size, CVE) does NOT apply.
    </background>
